bun provides the Bun 1.4.5 standalone JavaScript runtime built from source.

Binary
  Linux/macOS: tools/bun/bun
  Windows:     tools/bun\bun.exe

Run
  bun --version
  bun -e 'console.log(1+1)'

macOS
  The macOS build hardcodes a macOS 11.0 deployment target and rebuilds the
  pinned WebKit/JavaScriptCore locally. It must be built natively on macOS
  with SDK >= 13.0; cross-compiling from another OS is intentionally rejected.
  Verify with:
    otool -l tools/bun/bun | grep -A2 LC_BUILD_VERSION
  The output must show: minos 11.0

Other platforms
  Linux and Windows are built natively on their own hosts with the upstream
  prebuilt WebKit. The build host OS and architecture must match the target
  triplet; no cross-compilation is supported.
